Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,660] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 不要动夫人的钱包
Segment #2   [00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:03,420] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 8  | Text: 更不要动穷人的观念
Segment #3   [00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:05,800] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 8  | Text: 道家说过 顺其自然
Segment #4   [00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,240] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 8  | Text: 它这个自然不是大自然
Segment #5   [00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,040] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 而是规则
Segment #6   [00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,720] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 9  | Text: 我们要按照规则来办事
Segment #7   [00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:10,880] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 我讲之外一点
Segment #8   [00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,620] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是见什么样人下什么样彩蝶
Segment #9   [00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,020] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 见人下彩蝶
Segment #10  [00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,860] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 8  | Text: 见什么样的人说什么样的话
Segment #11  [00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:16,700] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 做什么样的事
Segment #12  [00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:17,960] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 3  | Text: 这个规则
Segment #13  [00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,980] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是我们为人出事最大的前提
Segment #14  [00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,200] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 你也可以理解为
Segment #15  [00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,720] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 11 | Text: 是我们财富获取的最大的前提
Segment #16  [00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:24,820] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 而夏天卖闪
Segment #17  [00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:25,700] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 冬天卖棉耳
Segment #18  [00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:26,800] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 这也是掌握的规则
Segment #19  [00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,340] | Elapsed:  15.28s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #20  [00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,660] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 你要是大夏天的
Segment #21  [00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,400] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 你弄出那些棉耳麦的
Segment #22  [00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,060] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 我问你
Segment #23  [00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,700] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 9  | Text: 夏天你会不会买棉耳麦
Segment #24  [00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:33,000] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 1  | Text: 不会
Segment #25  [00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,500] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 不会 是不是
Segment #26  [00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,040] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 儒家说
Segment #27  [00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,860] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 人意理智信
Segment #28  [00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,680] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 11 | Text: 我今天把这五个字给你们拆解
Segment #29  [00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,020] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 2  | Text: 为什么说
Segment #30  [00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:41,880] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 读万越书
Segment #31  [00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:42,840] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 不如行万里路
Segment #32  [00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,500] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 行万里路不如越人用书
Segment #33  [00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:45,360] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是有些字
Segment #34  [00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,440] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们从自愿的意思
Segment #35  [00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,120] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 去理解它
Segment #36  [00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:48,840] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 它只是道理
Segment #37  [00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,840] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是你把它落实到行动当中
Segment #38  [00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,000] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 套在我们自己的身上
Segment #39  [00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,080] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 7  | Text: 它就变成了精力
Segment #40  [00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:54,880] | Elapsed:  33.30s | Words: 5  | Text: 人意理智信
Segment #41  [00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,940] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 8  | Text: 这就是钱的循环之道
Segment #42  [00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,680] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 6  | Text: 人首先是要立它的
Segment #43  [00:00:58,680 --> 00:00:59,220] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #44  [00:00:59,220 --> 00:00:59,900] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 3  | Text: 你看我这个
Segment #45  [00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:01,860] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 9  | Text: 朵银卓业背景图挂梁
Segment #46  [00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:02,400] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 3  | Text: 这是叫什么
Segment #47  [00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,120] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 3  | Text: 叫立它
Segment #48  [00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:05,660] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 10 | Text: 我们要给别人创造出价值
Segment #49  [00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:06,560] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 2  | Text: 是吧
Segment #50  [00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,100] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 2  | Text: 一件事情
Segment #51  [00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:08,180] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 5  | Text: 当你要让所有人
Segment #52  [00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:09,120] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 4  | Text: 都有钱赚的时候
Segment #53  [00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,980] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 8  | Text: 所有人都会让你活着
Segment #54  [00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:12,300] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 8  | Text: 都会让你变得有钱
Segment #55  [00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:13,140] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 5  | Text: 这叫做立它
Segment #56  [00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:15,200] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 5  | Text: 意义是公平
Segment #57  [00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,380] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 4  | Text: 理智习惯
Segment #58  [00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:17,760] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 4  | Text: 知识反应
Segment #59  [00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,500] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 7  | Text: 信誓维持的基础
Segment #60  [00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:21,720] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 2  | Text: 怎么讲
Segment #61  [00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:22,420] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 4  | Text: 这五个字
Segment #62  [00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:23,300] | Elapsed:  50.18s | Words: 3  | Text: 你们一定要明白
Segment #63  [00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:25,620] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 8  | Text: 它是一个递进的关系
Segment #64  [00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:26,560] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 5  | Text: 一步一步的
Segment #65  [00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,440] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 绝非病例
Segment #66  [00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,460] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 你做生意
Segment #67  [00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:29,680] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 5  | Text: 你首先你要立它
Segment #68  [00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,080] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 7  | Text: 你才能拿到项目
Segment #69  [00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:32,340] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 6  | Text: 拿到业务之后
Segment #70  [00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:34,300] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 9  | Text: 会有很多人去给你干活
Segment #71  [00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:35,520] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #72  [00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:36,920] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 你去分配
Segment #73  [00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:37,840] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 这个人拿多少
Segment #74  [00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:38,500] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 那个人拿多少
Segment #75  [00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:39,380] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 那个人拿多少
Segment #76  [00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:40,040] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 该得多的
Segment #77  [00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:40,860] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 5  | Text: 你别给少了
Segment #78  [00:01:41,380 --> 00:01:42,400] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 6  | Text: 少的别给多了
Segment #79  [00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,320] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 5  | Text: 这叫做公平
Segment #80  [00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:44,140] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 讲究公平
Segment #81  [00:01:44,140 --> 00:01:45,000] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 这叫做意
Segment #82  [00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,480] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 4  | Text: 长此以往
Segment #83  [00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:49,060] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 12 | Text: 就会形成商业的习惯和规律
Segment #84  [00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:50,400] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 5  | Text: 这就叫做理
Segment #85  [00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:52,240] | Elapsed:  67.32s | Words: 8  | Text: 你只有按照规则办事
Segment #86  [00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:53,260] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 形成规章制度
Segment #87  [00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:56,500] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 12 | Text: 你才能发现什么叫做偶发事件
Segment #88  [00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:57,660] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 什么叫突发事件
Segment #89  [00:01:57,660 --> 00:01:58,500] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 应对这些情况
Segment #90  [00:01:58,500 --> 00:01:59,860] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 你应该怎么样去处理
Segment #91  [00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:00,800] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 4  | Text: 有什么风险
Segment #92  [00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:01,420] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 4  | Text: 有什么诱惑
Segment #93  [00:02:01,420 --> 00:02:02,620] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 都是这些骗子
Segment #94  [00:02:02,620 --> 00:02:03,400] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 你别被骗了
Segment #95  [00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:05,160] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 9  | Text: 怎么去规避掉这些东西
Segment #96  [00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:07,300] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个叫做智力的智
Segment #97  [00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,780] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 8  | Text: 你能够有效地应对
Segment #98  [00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:11,080] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 9  | Text: 你就像澳门的东西一样
Segment #99  [00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,580] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 8  | Text: 比方说我在澳门的工作
Segment #100 [00:02:12,580 --> 00:02:14,160] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 所有的跑幼的过来
Segment #101 [00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,020] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 把单拿过来之后
Segment #102 [00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:16,300] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 他们是拿大头的
Segment #103 [00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:16,880] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 2  | Text: 只有这样
Segment #104 [00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:19,080] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 8  | Text: 才会有源源不断的人
Segment #105 [00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:19,980] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 4  | Text: 来为你工作
Segment #106 [00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:20,660] | Elapsed:  85.27s | Words: 3  | Text: 你哪怕
Segment #107 [00:02:21,180 --> 00:02:22,940] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 10 | Text: 其实对任何一家公司来说
Segment #108 [00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:24,580] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 4  | Text: 你分得少
Segment #109 [00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:25,880] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 3  | Text: 你分得
Segment #110 [00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:26,920] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 实际到手的钱
Segment #111 [00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:28,060] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 5  | Text: 它是更多的
Segment #112 [00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:28,880] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #113 [00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,420] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 5  | Text: 我反正就这样
Segment #114 [00:02:31,420 --> 00:02:32,040] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 4  | Text: 现在做生意
Segment #115 [00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:33,980] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 没有合伙人的生意
Segment #116 [00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:34,520] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 4  | Text: 应该不做
Segment #117 [00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,160] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 3  | Text: 太累了
Segment #118 [00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:36,920] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 4  | Text: 我们继续聊
Segment #119 [00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:37,880] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 5  | Text: 聊到澳门了
Segment #120 [00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:38,740] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们就聊聊澳门
Segment #121 [00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,820] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 4  | Text: 澳门这个地方
Segment #122 [00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:42,160] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 从来不会相信人性
Segment #123 [00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:42,720] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 3  | Text: 在澳门
Segment #124 [00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:43,700] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 你也不要跟我聊人性
Segment #125 [00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:45,160] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们只谈规则
Segment #126 [00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,820] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 8  | Text: 用规则去束缚人性
Segment #127 [00:02:46,820 --> 00:02:48,360] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 当所有的东西都已经
Segment #128 [00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,940] | Elapsed: 101.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 形成一个小规模的时候
Segment #129 [00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:51,300] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 7  | Text: 发条式的运行的时候
Segment #130 [00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:52,600] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 7  | Text: 体制十分完善了
Segment #131 [00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:53,940] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 5  | Text: 没有任何一个人
Segment #132 [00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:55,620] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 9  | Text: 会去把这个规矩破坏了
Segment #133 [00:02:55,620 --> 00:02:56,880] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为一旦破坏了
Segment #134 [00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:57,780] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 4  | Text: 大家都没钱了
Segment #135 [00:02:57,780 --> 00:02:58,680] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 5  | Text: 都没得玩了
Segment #136 [00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,660] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 5  | Text: 你有单子甩给我
Segment #137 [00:02:59,660 --> 00:03:00,520] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 4  | Text: 我不跟你结算
Segment #138 [00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,820] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 6  | Text: 澳门就是很小的
Segment #139 [00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:04,280] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 9  | Text: 澳门就30个平方公里
Segment #140 [00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:04,960] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 3  | Text: 这圈子
Segment #141 [00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,140] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 7  | Text: 可能做旅游行业的
Segment #142 [00:03:06,140 --> 00:03:06,940] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 4  | Text: 1000人引力
Segment #143 [00:03:07,820 --> 00:03:08,620] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是这个圈子
Segment #144 [00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:09,320] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 3  | Text: 1000个人
Segment #145 [00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,160] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 5  | Text: 也就1000个人
Segment #146 [00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:10,860] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 4  | Text: 都弄错了
Segment #147 [00:03:10,860 --> 00:03:11,920] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 5  | Text: 都不给玩了
Segment #148 [00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,380] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 8  | Text: 虽然我们做旅游行业
Segment #149 [00:03:13,380 --> 00:03:13,980] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 2  | Text: 但是你看
Segment #150 [00:03:13,980 --> 00:03:15,920] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 7  | Text: 我们也是长期遵循了
Segment #151 [00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,540] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 5  | Text: 人意理智信
Segment #152 [00:03:17,540 --> 00:03:18,300] | Elapsed: 121.08s | Words: 4  | Text: 长此以往
Segment #153 [00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:19,840] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 那肯定是我信你
Segment #154 [00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,100] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 你信他信我
Segment #155 [00:03:21,100 --> 00:03:22,680] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 整个产业的产业链条
Segment #156 [00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,380] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 就完整了
Segment #157 [00:03:23,380 --> 00:03:24,300] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 3  | Text: 其实我跟你说
Segment #158 [00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:25,520] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 7  | Text: 这就是财富的循环
Segment #159 [00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,360] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 和增加之道
Segment #160 [00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:29,020] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 到家我们聊完了
Segment #161 [00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:30,160] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们再说回法家
Segment #162 [00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:31,520] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 3  | Text: 法家呢
Segment #163 [00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,740] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 8  | Text: 商业 理事 管众 礼物
Segment #164 [00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:35,320] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 这些人算是
Segment #165 [00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,660] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 宰相之财了吧
Segment #166 [00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:37,480] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 算是代表了吧
Segment #167 [00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,880] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 8  | Text: 他们倡导的理念是什么
Segment #168 [00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:41,220] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 9  | Text: 是财富能够世代相传
Segment #169 [00:03:41,220 --> 00:03:42,960] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 8  | Text: 是管理国家的策略
Segment #170 [00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,900] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 法家讲究的是民
Segment #171 [00:03:44,900 --> 00:03:46,000] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 以民为天
Segment #172 [00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,080] | Elapsed: 138.39s | Words: 5  | Text: 以天下为先
Segment #173 [00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,520] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是一切的财富
Segment #174 [00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,020] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 最终一定要回到
Segment #175 [00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:51,780] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 7  | Text: 个人和人民的手里
Segment #176 [00:03:51,780 --> 00:03:52,380] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 2  | Text: 只有这样
Segment #177 [00:03:52,380 --> 00:03:53,640] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 个人和天下
Segment #178 [00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:55,160] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 才允许你的财富
Segment #179 [00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:56,260] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 4  | Text: 代代相传
Segment #180 [00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:56,900] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 3  | Text: 所以说呢
Segment #181 [00:03:56,900 --> 00:03:58,660] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 9  | Text: 红军老祖在开天地的时候
Segment #182 [00:03:58,660 --> 00:04:00,360] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 7  | Text: 设置了三教九流
Segment #183 [00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,560] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 4  | Text: 什么是三教
Segment #184 [00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,720] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 3  | Text: 如法道
Segment #185 [00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:04,440] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 如家 法家 道家
Segment #186 [00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:04,860] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 2  | Text: 对吧
Segment #187 [00:04:04,860 --> 00:04:06,360] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 后艳化为九流
Segment #188 [00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:09,720] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 3  | Text: 如农道
Segment #189 [00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:11,260] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 3  | Text: 墨 法名
Segment #190 [00:04:11,260 --> 00:04:12,700] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 阴阳 小说家
Segment #191 [00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:13,200] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 3  | Text: 众神家
Segment #192 [00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:13,640] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #193 [00:04:14,060 --> 00:04:15,160] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 天下的财富
Segment #194 [00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:15,880] | Elapsed: 154.17s | Words: 3  | Text: 如何分配
Segment #195 [00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:16,780] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 2  | Text: 我跟你说
Segment #196 [00:04:16,780 --> 00:04:17,880] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 从这一刻开始
Segment #197 [00:04:19,460 --> 00:04:20,280] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 从这一刻开始
Segment #198 [00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:21,140] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 真的就已经定好了
Segment #199 [00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:22,780] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 有钱人
Segment #200 [00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:23,980] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 他真的不争对错
Segment #201 [00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:25,480] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 你哪怕你骂我
Segment #202 [00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:25,940] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 你打我
Segment #203 [00:04:25,940 --> 00:04:26,720] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 我还跟你玩
Segment #204 [00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,280] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #205 [00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,220] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为我只谈利币
Segment #206 [00:04:28,220 --> 00:04:28,820] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 我通过你
Segment #207 [00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:29,620] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 我能赚到多少钱
Segment #208 [00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:30,580] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 你别说打我了
Segment #209 [00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:31,360] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 你打我左脸一下
Segment #210 [00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,480] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 我都在把右脸伸出来
Segment #211 [00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,060] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 让你打一下
Segment #212 [00:04:33,060 --> 00:04:33,440] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #213 [00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,640] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为左脸种的
Segment #214 [00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,280] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 右脸没种
Segment #215 [00:04:35,820 --> 00:04:36,460] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 2  | Text: 不对称
Segment #216 [00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:37,420] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 我问你一下
Segment #217 [00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:38,880] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 1  | Text: 现在
Segment #218 [00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,240] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 我要打你一顿
Segment #219 [00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,380] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是你有钱赚
Segment #220 [00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:42,060] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 你让不让我打
Segment #221 [00:04:42,060 --> 00:04:42,420] | Elapsed: 171.09s | Words: 1  | Text: 打
Segment #222 [00:04:42,420 --> 00:04:43,520] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 争不争对错
Segment #223 [00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:44,180] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 2  | Text: 不争
Segment #224 [00:04:44,180 --> 00:04:45,300] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 你错了吗
Segment #225 [00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:45,800] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 3  | Text: 我错了
Segment #226 [00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,640] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 你必须错了
Segment #227 [00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:47,420] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 2  | Text: 所以说
Segment #228 [00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:48,260] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是穷人不一样
Segment #229 [00:04:48,260 --> 00:04:48,840] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 3  | Text: 穷人呢
Segment #230 [00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:49,960] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 他不看利币
Segment #231 [00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,780] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 他只争对错
Segment #232 [00:04:50,780 --> 00:04:51,740] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 3  | Text: 就这件事情
Segment #233 [00:04:51,740 --> 00:04:53,060] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 有可能我们撕破脸了
Segment #234 [00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:53,900] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 有可能到最后
Segment #235 [00:04:53,900 --> 00:04:54,760] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 大家都没有钱赚
Segment #236 [00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:55,900] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是我必须给你
Segment #237 [00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:57,660] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 论个书音高低
Segment #238 [00:04:58,260 --> 00:04:59,400] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是你要跟我证明
Segment #239 [00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:00,940] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 3  | Text: 我是错的
Segment #240 [00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:02,260] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 你才是对的
Segment #241 [00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:02,700] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 2  | Text: 所以说
Segment #242 [00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:03,660] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 人走到哪一步
Segment #243 [00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:04,520] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 都是有原因的
Segment #244 [00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:05,880] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 你永远叫不醒
Segment #245 [00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:06,680] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 一个装睡的人
Segment #246 [00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:09,560] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 迷失 失度
Segment #247 [00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,580] | Elapsed: 188.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 这四个字是什么意思
Segment #248 [00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,080] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是在你迷惑的时候
Segment #249 [00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,880] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 10 | Text: 能有一个为你提供的知识
Segment #250 [00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,020] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 7  | Text: 能够帮助到你的人
Segment #251 [00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:15,980] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 5  | Text: 你看你现在信息
Segment #252 [00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:16,500] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 3  | Text: 这么发达
Segment #253 [00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:17,840] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 5  | Text: 短视频平台
Segment #254 [00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,940] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 4  | Text: 知识这么多
Segment #255 [00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:20,820] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 8  | Text: 你唯一要克服的是什么
Segment #256 [00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:21,640] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 4  | Text: 就比方说
Segment #257 [00:05:22,620 --> 00:05:23,840] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是贪称吃
Segment #258 [00:05:24,980 --> 00:05:26,200] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 5  | Text: 你好色平台
Segment #259 [00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,640] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 6  | Text: 会给你吞美女
Segment #260 [00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,300] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 8  | Text: 你突然想了健身了
Segment #261 [00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:30,660] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 8  | Text: 你看到的就是健身大人
Segment #262 [00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:32,420] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 7  | Text: 你是一个饭店的厨子
Segment #263 [00:05:32,420 --> 00:05:34,100] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 8  | Text: 给你推荐的都是炒菜
Segment #264 [00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:35,380] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 7  | Text: 很难让你学习到
Segment #265 [00:05:35,380 --> 00:05:36,860] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 9  | Text: 专业以外的爱好和工作
Segment #266 [00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:37,960] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #267 [00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:38,860] | Elapsed: 206.08s | Words: 2  | Text: 看不到
Segment #268 [00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,380] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 学习不到我们
Segment #269 [00:05:40,980 --> 00:05:42,140] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 所擅长的东西
Segment #270 [00:05:42,140 --> 00:05:42,940] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 以外的东西
Segment #271 [00:05:42,940 --> 00:05:44,320] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 接触不到外边的信息
Segment #272 [00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:45,780] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 10 | Text: 这个东西也叫做知识垄断
Segment #273 [00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:46,980] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 那真的以后
Segment #274 [00:05:46,980 --> 00:05:49,000] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 9  | Text: 赚钱可就和你无关了
Segment #275 [00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,360] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以你要主动的去
Segment #276 [00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,340] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 寻找工作以外的知识
Segment #277 [00:05:52,340 --> 00:05:54,400] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 更重要的是去突破人性
Segment #278 [00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:54,860] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 2  | Text: 突破
Segment #279 [00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:56,760] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为人性总会让你
Segment #280 [00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:57,700] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 刷到些这些
Segment #281 [00:05:57,700 --> 00:05:59,160] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 跳舞的健身教练
Segment #282 [00:05:59,160 --> 00:05:59,740] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 这些东西
Segment #283 [00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,800] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 如果你还没有想明白
Segment #284 [00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,420] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 打破不了
Segment #285 [00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:03,560] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 你就做不了
Segment #286 [00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,000] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 知情合一的壁垒了
Segment #287 [00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:05,600] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #288 [00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,900] | Elapsed: 224.09s | Words: 9  | Text: 我看你现在刷到的东西
Segment #289 [00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:08,220] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 2  | Text: 是什么
Segment #290 [00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,720] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 刷看一圈
Segment #291 [00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,600] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 刷看美女
Segment #292 [00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,600] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 老天们
Segment #293 [00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,060] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 咱不说知情合一了
Segment #294 [00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:14,500] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 咱就说
Segment #295 [00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:15,900] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 出来混醉重要的是什么
Segment #296 [00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,160] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 2  | Text: 是出来
Segment #297 [00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:17,840] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #298 [00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:18,400] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 2  | Text: 是来
Segment #299 [00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:20,640] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 剩毛毛了
Segment #300 [00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:21,600] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 你出来还不能说
Segment #301 [00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:22,480] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 我再给你睡了
Segment #302 [00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:25,980] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 行 加油吧
Segment #303 [00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:27,680] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 莫生人 祝你们
Segment #304 [00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,760] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 越来越好
Segment #305 [00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,000] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 我感觉我那句话
Segment #306 [00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,300] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 说得很有道理
Segment #307 [00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:35,300] | Elapsed: 238.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 要知道这个世界的游戏规则
Segment #308 [00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:39,960] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 4  | Text: 你要让你的钱
Segment #309 [00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:43,140] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 8  | Text: 回归到天下和个人
Segment #310 [00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:44,880] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 5  | Text: 天下和个人
Segment #311 [00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,520] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 4  | Text: 才允许你的
Segment #312 [00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,560] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 4  | Text: 实在传承
Segment #313 [00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:50,980] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 6  | Text: 你能懂老天们
Segment #314 [00:06:50,980 --> 00:06:51,620] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 4  | Text: 不一定懂的
Segment #315 [00:06:52,520 --> 00:06:53,180] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 2  | Text: 所以说
Segment #316 [00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,200] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 2  | Text: 下一步
Segment #317 [00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:56,100] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 5  | Text: 我们要做好事
Segment #318 [00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:56,900] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 3  | Text: 做善事
Segment #319 [00:06:58,860 --> 00:06:59,660] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 2  | Text: 要没事
Segment #320 [00:07:00,940 --> 00:07:02,140] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 5  | Text: 好 不多说了
Segment #321 [00:07:02,140 --> 00:07:02,800] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 3  | Text: 就这样了
Segment #322 [00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:02,920] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 1  | Text: 拜拜
Segment #323 [00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:03,700] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油 莫生人
Segment #324 [00:07:03,700 --> 00:07:04,600] | Elapsed: 250.67s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
